---
import Glyph from "./Glyph.astro"
---
  <section id="keys" class="band inv reveal" data-comp="Keys" data-src="src/components/Keys.astro:1">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Your hands stay on the keyboard</h2>
      <p class="lede"><span class="kb-only">Every tool has a key. Press one here to see it go down, or press <kbd>C</kbd> in the demo above to start a round of your own.</span><span class="touch-only">On a phone you tap. On your laptop, every tool has a key, so you can review without reaching for the mouse.</span></p>
      <div class="keybed">
        <div class="tray">
          <h3>Point and move</h3>
          <div class="k"><span class="caps"><span class="cap c8 i-cobalt" data-key="c">C</span></span><span class="kl">Pick an element</span></div>
          <div class="k"><span class="caps"><span class="cap" data-key="d">D</span></span><span class="kl">Point at an exact spot</span></div>
          <div class="k"><span class="caps"><span class="cap" data-key="a">A</span></span><span class="kl">Drag out an area</span></div>
          <div class="k"><span class="caps"><span class="cap" data-key="arrowup">↑</span><span class="cap" data-key="arrowdown">↓</span></span><span class="kl">Climb to the parent or back</span></div>
          <div class="k"><span class="caps"><span class="cap wide" data-key="enter">Enter</span></span><span class="kl">Write a note on it</span></div>
          <div class="k"><span class="caps"><span class="cap wide" data-key=" ">Space</span></span><span class="kl">Hold to peek under the overlay</span></div>
          <div class="k"><span class="caps"><span class="cap" data-key="r">R</span></span><span class="kl">Open the round</span></div>
          <div class="k"><span class="caps"><span class="cap" data-mod data-key="meta">⌘</span><span class="cap" data-key="k">K</span></span><span class="kl">Search every command</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="itray">
          <h3>Say what kind of note it is</h3>
          <div class="ik i-fix"><span class="cap c8" data-key="1">1</span><span class="kl"><span><Glyph intent="fix" size={20} />Fix</span><small>Something is broken</small></span></div>
          <div class="ik i-change"><span class="cap c8" data-key="2">2</span><span class="kl"><span><Glyph intent="change" size={20} />Change</span><small>Make it something else</small></span></div>
          <div class="ik i-question"><span class="cap c8" data-key="3">3</span><span class="kl"><span><Glyph intent="question" size={20} />Question</span><small>Ask about it</small></span></div>
          <div class="ik i-keep"><span class="cap c8" data-key="4">4</span><span class="kl"><span><Glyph intent="keep" size={20} />Keep</span><small>Leave it exactly as is</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="budget"><b>Typing never waits on the page.</b> iter8’s test gate fails a build if any main-thread task runs past 50&nbsp;ms while you hover, pick and type on a heavy page.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

<script>
  import "../scripts/keys.js"
</script>
